      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SHE SMASHES (3) improved sharply on her fourth two starts back at Alpha with success as public elect over 1000m at this track three-and-a-half weeks ago, getting home by a head after being in contention on the corner. Well placed and there is no reason why she cannot repeat the dose. LAST DITCH EFFORT (6) finished out of the money two starts back then was beaten 7 lengths when fourth over 1100m at Julia Creek a week-and-a-half ago. Has a solid record at this course and distance, including two wins. Going up a level this time but he deserves another chance. NAPOLEON STRIKE (1) spoiled a good run of form last start when fifth over 1100m at Julia Creek. Record at this track is strong and is too good to ignore. OCTOBER REVOLUTION (4) was out of the money two runs back then again missed the frame last start over 1400m at Hughenden, beaten 6 lengths into fifth. Has his share of talent and will prove hard to beat in this suitable race.",
